## 📊 Example Output

```
$ loglens query "show me failed logins in the last hour" /var/log/auth.log

  ✓ Loaded 12,847 logs

Query Interpretation
  Looking for authentication failures within the last 60 minutes

Results
  Total matches: 47
  Returned: 20

  Found 47 failed login attempts in the last hour.
  
  89% originated from IP 185.220.101.34 (known Tor exit node)
  Targeted accounts: admin (23), root (12), svc_backup (8)
  Peak activity: 03:42 AM (23 attempts in 5 minutes)

Matching Events
  ▶ 2024-01-15T03:42:17 Failed password for admin from 185.220.101.34 [HIGH]
  ▶ 2024-01-15T03:42:19 Failed password for admin from 185.220.101.34 [HIGH]
  ▶ 2024-01-15T03:42:21 Failed password for root from 185.220.101.34 [HIGH]
  ...

Insights
  • Brute force attack pattern detected from Tor exit node
  • Attack targeted privileged accounts
  • Timing suggests automated attack tool

Suggested Follow-up Queries
  1. show successful logins from 185.220.101.34
  2. what else happened at 3:42 AM
  3. show all Tor activity this week
```

